# StudyMate Notes App

## Overview
StudyMate is a full‑stack notes application with AI integration.  
Features:
- React frontend (Vite)
- Express + MongoDB backend
- MCP server tools for Claude Desktop
- AI summarization (OpenAI/Claude)

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: React + Vite
- Backend: Express + MongoDB (Mongoose)
- AI: OpenAI GPT‑4o‑mini (or Claude)
- MCP: Node MCP server over stdio

